id: pm-rust-s6j4
title: Extend native orientation to richer context sections and relationship packets
description: "Follow-up to the native brief orientation slice: implement context intents, deeper sections, calendar recurrence and timezone handling, workspace-memory rollups, derived-snapshot recovery, dependency relationship-context packets, richer history projections and canonical output continuation controls. Keep unsupported requests explicit until each contract has exact oracle differentials."
